### ============================================================
### 09-SpringIntegration API Testing (Port: 8109)
### ============================================================

### 1. Gửi đơn hàng Standard (EIP: Gateway -> Router -> Standard Pipeline -> Aggregator)
POST http://localhost:8109/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1001",
  "customerName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "orderType": "STANDARD",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "P1",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 50.0
    },
    {
      "productId": "P2",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 120.0
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Gửi đơn hàng Express (EIP: Gateway -> Router -> Express Pipeline with Priority Discount)
POST http://localhost:8109/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1002",
  "customerName": "Tran Thi B",
  "orderType": "EXPRESS",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "P3",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 500.0
    }
  ]
}
